OL,3,GNEWSACharity donations stolen from
OL,4,AHalloween display
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen charity donations
OL,7,Ffrom a Halloween display which took
OL,8,Fmonths to prepare.
OL,10,FPhilip Pattinson has been putting on
OL,11,Fdisplays at his home in Whitehaven for
OL,12,Fthe past six years and this year is
OL,13,Fraising money for Hospice at Home West
OL,14,FCumbria.
OL,16,FBut on Thursday morning, he discovered
OL,17,Fthis year's wrestling-themed display
OL,18,Fhad been damaged and a collection box
OL,19,Fwith a week's worth of donations had
OL,20,Fbeen taken.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
