OL,3,GNEWSACharity donations stolen from
OL,4,AHalloween display
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think if it had just been my stuff,
OL,7,FI'd have just been angry, but I just
OL,8,Fstarted feeling sad, the money's for
OL,9,Fcharity and somebody's stolen that
OL,10,Fmoney that people have donated,"
OL,11,FPattinson told BBC Radio Cumbria.
